    "text": "Today Overcast. High 66F. Winds SW at 10 to 20 mph. Tonight A steady rain this evening. Showers continuing overnight. Low near 45F. Winds WSW at 10 to 15 mph. Chance of rain 70%. Tomorrow Cloudy skies early, then partly cloudy in the afternoon. High 48F. Winds NNW at 10 to 20 mph. Tomorrow Night Generally fair. Low near 25F. Winds N at 5 to 10 mph. Saturday Intervals of clouds and sunshine in the morning with more clouds for later in the day. High around 35F. Winds NNW at 10 to 15 mph. Saturday Night Partly cloudy skies. Low 27F. Winds WNW at 5 to 10 mph. Sunday Sunny along with a few clouds. High 49F. Winds SW at 10 to 20 mph. Sunday Night Partly cloudy skies early will become overcast later during the night. Low 39F. Winds SW at 10 to 20 mph. Monday Mainly cloudy. High 62F. Winds SW at 10 to 20 mph. Monday Night Partly cloudy skies. Low 47F. Winds WSW at 10 to 15 mph. Tuesday Partly to mostly cloudy. High 64F. Winds SW at 10 to 15 mph. Tuesday Night Overcast with showers at times. Low 47F. Winds S at 10 to 15 mph. Chance of rain 60%. Wednesday Cloudy with occasional rain showers. High 64F. Winds S at 10 to 15 mph. Chance of rain 60%. Wednesday Night Steady light rain in the evening. Showers continuing late. Low 44F. SW winds shifting to NW at 10 to 15 mph. Chance of rain 60%. Thursday Considerable cloudiness. Occasional rain showers in the afternoon. High around 55F. N winds shifting to ESE at 10 to 15 mph. Chance of rain 40%. Thursday Night Cloudy with showers. Low 41F. Winds ESE at 10 to 15 mph. Chance of rain 50%. Friday Considerable cloudiness with occasional rain showers. High 47F. Winds ENE at 10 to 20 mph. Chance of rain 50%. Friday Night Cloudy with occasional rain showers. Low around 40F. Winds ENE at 10 to 15 mph. Chance of rain 50%. Saturday Cloudy skies. High 48F. Winds ENE at 10 to 15 mph. Saturday Night Cloudy with showers. Low 43F. Winds SSE at 10 to 15 mph. Chance of rain 40%.",
